{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "This permission is given on a temporary basis for a ten (10) year period commencing from November 2022 and finishing on the 30th January 2032. All development and associated works carried out under this permission shall not be installed before October and shall be removed at the end of each event and by no later than the 21st January in any year between the consented period between 2022-2032, and the land reinstated to its former condition to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority. \r\nREASON: To comply with the terms upon which this application has been assessed and as it would be inappropriate to grant a permanent permission for inappropriate buildings in designated Metropolitan Open Land, World Heritage site, the Royal Botanic Gardens Kew Conservation Area and on the English Heritage Register of Historic Parks and Gardens and the setting of listed buildings."
